{"file":"InsForge-1.2.0-v2.zip","bytes":245817,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"insforge","description":"The backend platform for AI-native developers. A Postgres-based backend with auth, storage, compute, hosting, and AI gateway — built for coding agents. This plugin gives agents the full InsForge surface: database CRUD with RLS, authentication, storage, edge functions, AI, realtime, Stripe payments, and deployments. Includes CLI infrastructure management, debugging diagnostics, and integration guides for third-party auth providers (Auth0, Clerk, Kinde, Stytch, WorkOS).","version":"1.2.0","license":"Apache-2.0","repository":"https://github.com/InsForge/insforge-skills","homepage":"https://docs.insforge.dev","keywords":["insforge","ai-native","coding-agents","ai-agents","backend-as-a-service","baas","postgres","auth","storage","compute","hosting","ai-gateway","edge-functions","stripe","rls"]},{"path":".codex-plugin/plugin.json","name":"insforge","description":"InsForge skills for building AI-native apps with Postgres, auth, storage, compute, hosting, AI gateway, realtime, payments, integrations, and diagnostics.","version":"1.3.0","license":"Apache-2.0","repository":"https://github.com/InsForge/insforge-skills","homepage":"https://docs.insforge.dev","keywords":["insforge","ai-native","coding-agents","backend-as-a-service","baas","postgres","auth","storage","compute","hosting","ai-gateway","edge-functions","stripe","razorpay","rls"]}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/insforge-cli/SKILL.md","name":"insforge-cli","description":"Use this skill whenever someone needs a backend, or a task touches InsForge backend or cloud infrastructure through the InsForge CLI: projects, SQL, migrations, RLS policies, functions, storage, backups, deployments, compute, secrets, config, schedules, logs, diagnostics, advisor scans and suppressions, import/export, AI/OpenRouter setup and usage overview, Stripe/Razorpay payments, Apify web scraping / data sources, PostHog product analytics, backend branches, organization membership (invite, leave, delete), agent memory (remember/recall project facts and decisions), reporting InsForge-side bugs or doc discrepancies (feedback), or CLI docs. For app code with InsForge or @insforge/sdk, use the insforge app-integration skill instead.","headings":["InsForge CLI","Core Rules","Global Options","Exit Codes","Environment Variables","Connection Setup","Command Routing","Database Workflow","Project and Configuration","Organizations and Members","Billing and Usage","Backups","Storage","Realtime","Edge Functions","AI Gateway","Memory","Payments"],"name_hint":"insforge · cli","description_zh":"通过 InsForge CLI 管理后端及云基础设施，包括项目、SQL迁移、RLS、函数、存储、备份部署、计算、密钥配置、排程日志、诊断审查、导入导出、AI与支付和外部数据接入、分支成员、代理记忆及反馈文档；应用SDK代码交由 insforge。"},{"path":"skills/insforge-debug/SKILL.md","name":"insforge-debug","description":"Use when diagnosing problems in an InsForge project — reactive failures (SDK error object, HTTP 4xx/5xx, gateway timeout 502/503/504, edge function failure or timeout, login/OAuth/auth errors, RLS denial, realtime channel issues, slow query on one endpoint, edge function or Vercel deploy failure), proactive audits (security/RLS review, performance/index review, system health check, pre-launch readiness), or when the user has an error but doesn't know where to start.","headings":["InsForge Debug","Fastest Path: AI-Assisted Triage","Debug Primitives","Symptom Recipes","Recipe: SDK returned `{ data: null, error: { code, message } }`","Recipe: HTTP 4xx/5xx response on a specific request","Recipe: RLS access issue (403 on write, or empty result on read)","Recipe: Login fails / OAuth callback errors / token expired","Recipe: Edge function runtime error / timeout","Recipe: `functions deploy` failed","Recipe: `deployments deploy` failed (Vercel)","Recipe: Single slow query / one endpoint slow","Recipe: \"Memory is at ~80% but nothing is slow\"","Recipe: All responses slow / high CPU/memory (active incident)","Recipe: Realtime channel won't connect / messages missing","Recipe: 429 rate limit","Recipe: Gateway timeout (502 / 503 / 504) on a specific URL","Recipe: Pre-launch / proactive audit"],"name_hint":"insforge · 排错","description_zh":"诊断 InsForge 的SDK或HTTP错误、网关和函数超时、登录OAuth、RLS、实时通道、慢查询及部署失败，也支持安全、性能、健康和上线准备审查。"},{"path":"skills/insforge-integrations/SKILL.md","name":"insforge-integrations","description":"Use when wiring an external auth provider (Clerk, Auth0, WorkOS, Kinde, Stytch, Better Auth) into InsForge for JWT-based RLS, or when adding the OKX x402 payment facilitator for onchain pay-per-use billing.","headings":["InsForge Integrations","Auth Providers","Payment Facilitators","Common Patterns","Auth providers","Payment facilitators (x402)","Choosing a Provider","Setup","Usage Examples","Best Practices","Common Mistakes"],"name_hint":"insforge · 集成","description_zh":"为 InsForge 接入 Clerk、Auth0、WorkOS、Kinde、Stytch、Better Auth 等外部认证以实现JWT行级权限，或接入 OKX x402 实现链上按使用量付费。"},{"path":"skills/insforge/SKILL.md","name":"insforge","description":"Use this skill when writing app code with InsForge or @insforge/sdk: database CRUD, auth, storage uploads/storage RLS, functions, OpenRouter AI, realtime, emails, Stripe or Razorpay payments, or pointing S3-compatible tooling (aws CLI, AWS SDKs, rclone, Terraform, boto3) at InsForge Storage. Trigger on requests like add auth, fetch data, upload files, make a bucket public, add checkout, sell subscriptions, or send email. For infrastructure, SQL migrations, CLI commands, or payment provider setup, use insforge-cli instead.","headings":["InsForge App Integration Skill","Quick Setup","1. Install the SDK","2. Set up environment variables","3. Initialize the client","Module Reference","What Each Module Covers","Guides","Building Payments for a New App","Real-time Backend Setup","Backend Configuration","Risky backend changes? Use a branch first","... apply migrations / change auth config / update RLS on the branch ...","... test the SDK against the branch backend ...","SDK Quick Reference","Important Notes"],"name_hint":"insforge","description_zh":"使用 InsForge 或 @insforge/sdk 编写数据库CRUD、认证、存储上传与RLS、函数、OpenRouter AI、实时、邮件和支付应用代码，或把S3兼容工具接到InsForge Storage；基础设施、迁移、CLI及支付商配置交由 insforge-cli。"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["InsForge Agent Skills","Installation","Codex plugin marketplace","Using the skills registry","Claude Code","Available Skills","Usage","Skill Structure","Documentation Pattern","Contributing","License"]}],"mcp_servers":[],"config_names":[],"paths":[".agents/plugins/marketplace.json",".claude-plugin/marketplace.json",".claude-plugin/plugin.json",".claude/settings.json",".claude/settings.local.json",".codex-plugin/plugin.json",".gitattributes",".gitignore","AGENTS.md","CONTRIBUTING.md","LICENSE","README.md","assets/insforge-favicon.png","skills/insforge-cli/SKILL.md","skills/insforge-cli/agents/openai.yaml","skills/insforge-cli/references/auth.md","skills/insforge-cli/references/branch/merge.md","skills/insforge-cli/references/branch/overview.md","skills/insforge-cli/references/branch/reset.md","skills/insforge-cli/references/compute-deploy.md","skills/insforge-cli/references/config.md","skills/insforge-cli/references/create.md","skills/insforge-cli/references/database/access-control.md","skills/insforge-cli/references/database/export.md","skills/insforge-cli/references/database/import.md","skills/insforge-cli/references/database/integrity.md","skills/insforge-cli/references/database/migrations.md","skills/insforge-cli/references/database/query.md","skills/insforge-cli/references/database/vector.md","skills/insforge-cli/references/deployments/deploy.md","skills/insforge-cli/references/deployments/domains.md","skills/insforge-cli/references/diagnostics.md","skills/insforge-cli/references/functions-deploy.md","skills/insforge-cli/references/local.md","skills/insforge-cli/references/login.md","skills/insforge-cli/references/memory.md","skills/insforge-cli/r